  "body": "**Link to problem area**:\r\n\r\nhttps://spec.matrix.org/unstable/push-gateway-api/\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\n\r\n`PusherData` is mentioned in https://spec.matrix.org/unstable/push-gateway-api/, but the format is not spelled out anywhere. `event_id_only` and `format` are mentioned, but do not link to anywhere. It *is* spelled out in the [C2S API](https://spec.matrix.org/unstable/client-server-api/#post_matrixclientv3pushersset), though, if that's supposed to be the same thing.\r\n\r\nThe Push Gateway API should either spell out what `PusherData` is or link to an appropriate section elsewhere.\r\n",
